and code-system text taken from the third-party terminologies listed below,
which belong to their owners. This file names, for each terminology, the
owner, the edition bundled and the page the owner publishes about use of its
content. Statements are quoted verbatim from those pages, with the URL, as
read on 2026-11-28. A page that could not be read, or that states no terms
for this content, is marked "not confirmed". This file states facts only: it
does not grant, describe or interpret any licence on behalf of an owner, and
it is not legal advice. The files, the counts and what each one copies are
listed in THIRD_PARTY_TERMINOLOGIES.md.


MEDIS-DC 医薬品HOTコードマスター and 標準病名マスター
-------------------------------------------------------
Owner: 一般財団法人医療情報システム開発センター (MEDIS-DC)
Bundled: YJ codes and product names (販売名) of the 医薬品HOTコードマスター,
  editions 2026-08-31 (clinosim/codes/authoritative/yj_medis_hot_used.json)
  and 2026-10-31 (yj_medis_hot_20261031.json; clinosim/codes/data/yj.yaml);
  2 disease names of the 標準病名マスター 5.18 as packaged in jpfhir-terminology
  2.2606.0 (clinosim/codes/data/medis-disease-keyno.yaml).
Statement of use (written for clinosim; MEDIS-DC asks that use of its
standard masters be stated, see the sentence quoted below):
  clinosim uses the MEDIS-DC standard masters 医薬品HOTコードマスター and
  ICD10対応標準病名マスター of 一般財団法人医療情報システム開発センター
  (MEDIS-DC); the codes and names listed above are extracts of them.
  clinosim は MEDIS-DC の標準マスター（医薬品HOTコードマスター、
  ICD10対応標準病名マスター）を利用しています。
Page read: 「MEDIS 標準マスター総合サイト」
  https://www.medis.or.jp/4_hyojyun/medis-master/riyou/index.html
  「どなたでも自由にダウンロードして使用できます。」
  「ただし、医療機関以外での使用若しくは配布目的で利用する場合は、「使用許諾申請書（pdf; 97KB）」を提出し、許可を得る必要があります。」
  「使用許諾を必要とするマスター種は次の通りです。」 「医薬品HOTコードマスター、病名マスター、歯科病名マスター、手術・処置マスター、看護実践用語標準マスター、症状所見マスター」
  「ダウンロードしたマスターを改変し配布する場合は、MEDIS-DCの標準マスターを利用したことを必ず明記してください。」
  「なお、改変したものについての責任はMEDIS-DCでは一切負いませんので、ご注意ください。」
Also read: 「医薬品HOTコードマスター」 https://www2.medis.or.jp/hcode/ (no terms
  of use on the page); 「ICD10対応標準病名マスター トップページ」
  https://www2.medis.or.jp/stdcd/byomei/ (repeats the 使用許諾申請書 and 明記
  sentences above).
The repository records no 使用許諾申請書 or permission.


RxNorm
------
Owner: U.S. National Library of Medicine (NLM)
Bundled: RxCUIs with drug names (clinosim/codes/data/rxnorm.yaml,
  rxnorm_scd.yaml, drugs.yaml), checked against RxNav as read on 2026-10-28
  and 2026-11-09 (clinosim/codes/authoritative/rxnorm_rxnav_snapshot.json).
Statement NLM requests:
  "This product uses publicly available data courtesy of the U.S. National
  Library of Medicine (NLM), National Institutes of Health, Department of
  Health and Human Services; NLM is not responsible for the product and does
  not endorse or recommend this or any other product."
Page read: "RxNorm Terms of Service"
  https://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm/docs/termsofservice.html
  "We request that any product that makes use of RxNorm data include the following statement:" (the statement above)
  "The RxNorm terminology normalized names and codes (e.g. RXCUI) within the RxNorm dataset is created by the National Library of Medicine (NLM) and is in the public domain as it is created by the U.S. government. Public domain information may be freely distributed and copied within and outside the U.S., but it is requested that in any subsequent use, NLM be given appropriate acknowledgement."
  "Users who republish or redistribute the data (services, products or raw data) agree to: maintain the most current version of all distributed data, or make known in a clear and conspicuous manner that the products/services/applications do not reflect the most current/accurate data available from NLM."
The RxNorm codes and names bundled with clinosim were checked against RxNav on
the dates above; they do not necessarily reflect the most current data
available from NLM.


